    "preamble": "Arun Kumar And 2 Ors vs The State Of Assam And Anr on 28 May, 2020 Author: Ajai Lamba Bench: Ajai Lamba Pag Gahc010018902015 The Gauhati High Court (High Court Of Assam, Nagaland, Mizoram And Arunachal Pradesh) Case No. : Crl.Pet. 626/2015 1:Arun Kumar and 2 Ors S/O Sri Badhaur Hari Chief, Hotel Brahmaputra Ashok, M.G. Road, Guwahati- 781001. 2: Sri Nitin Dewan S/O Sri Prakash Dewan Ex-Genral Manager Hotel Bramaputra Ashok Mg. Road Guwahati- 781001 Presently Posting As Generla Manager At Hotel Patliputra Ashokm Birchand Patel Path Patna- 800001. 3: Hotel Brahmaputra Ashok Rep. By Its Managing Director M.G. Road Guwahati- 781001 Versus 1:The State Of Assam and Anr 2:The Food Safety Officer Kamrup Metro Dist. Guwahati- 781001 Counsel for the Petitioner(s) : Mr. J. Singh, Advocate Counsel for the Respondent(s) : Mr. N. J. Dutta, Addl. Public Prosecutor, Assam.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "3. Sri Arun Kumar, Sri Nitin Dewan and Hotel Brahmaputra Ashok represented by its Managing Director have preferred this petition under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure for quashing complaint dated 25.10.2013, CR Case No.3909 C/2013 pending in the Court of Chief Judicial Magistrate, Kamrup (Metro) at Guwahati, under Sections 26(2)(i)/59 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
